OL,3,GNEWSA'Painful week' for family after
OL,4,Asuspected murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a suspected murder victim
OL,7,Fin Alderney have thanked the tiny
OL,8,Fisland's community during an
OL,9,F"unimaginably painful week".
OL,11,FThe body of 34-year-old Hannah Benfield
OL,12,Fwas found in the sea at the base of
OL,13,Fcliffs in the west of the island on
OL,14,FMonday, Guernsey Police said.
OL,16,FA 44-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of her murder and he remains
OL,18,Fin police custody.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
