OL,3,GNEWSA'Painful week' for family after
OL,4,Asuspected murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media posted
OL,7,Fon behalf of the family, they thanked
OL,8,Fthe island's "very special community"
OL,9,Ffor their support.
